    <informations>Shelly DALI Dimmer Gen3 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: DA+ DA− S1 S2 L N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-dali-dimmer-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_1c295d51c2d37500804c744e0e670768f9d92a139401d5501fac89dd817a80f4/Dali%20Dimmer%20Gen3-wiring%20diagram.png?cb=2b7aef016d7d4ecd508b4671ebe2d978
https://www.shelly.com/products/shelly-dali-dimmer-gen3

Notes:
- Official KB page currently resolves to Bulgarian safety guide. Official Shelly shop supplies specifications. Wiring diagram confirms six screws, blank pitch2.

Open points:
- Official shop explicitly labels Size HxWxD=42x37x17, unlike most standard bodies H37/W42; literal manufacturer axes are retained.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
